1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,698
In this lesson, we'll go
deep into the page builder,

2
00:00:03,698 --> 00:00:07,818
the drag and drop editor behind
every funnel and website in Kyntlo.

3
00:00:07,818 --> 00:00:12,184
Once you understand how a page is
put together, you can build anything.

4
00:00:13,036 --> 00:00:16,916
Here's Bloom's Invisalign landing
page, open in the builder.

5
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:21,959
Along the top: switch between desktop
and mobile view, undo and redo, preview,

6
00:00:21,959 --> 00:00:23,059
save and publish.

7
00:00:23,059 --> 00:00:26,421
Elements are on the left,
settings are on the right,

8
00:00:26,421 --> 00:00:28,555
and your page sits in the middle.

9
00:00:29,406 --> 00:00:34,160
Every page is built from four building
blocks, nested inside each other.

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,744
Open Layers to see them.

11
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:40,828
Sections are the big horizontal bands
of your page, like the hero at the top.

12
00:00:40,828 --> 00:00:43,337
Click one, and it's outlined in green.

13
00:00:44,189 --> 00:00:48,004
Inside each section are rows,
and rows split into columns.

14
00:00:48,004 --> 00:00:53,004
This hero row has two columns: text on
the left, and the image on the right.

15
00:00:53,004 --> 00:00:57,411
On a phone, those columns stack on
top of each other automatically.

16
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:02,670
And inside columns are elements:
the headlines, paragraphs, images,

17
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,632
buttons and forms your
visitors actually see.

18
00:01:05,632 --> 00:01:07,672
Click any element to select it.

19
00:01:07,672 --> 00:01:11,556
It gets a blue outline, and
its settings open on the right.

20
00:01:12,408 --> 00:01:16,179
To change the words, just click
the text on the page and type.

21
00:01:16,179 --> 00:01:19,889
Select the headline, highlight
the text, and write a new one.

22
00:01:19,889 --> 00:01:23,051
What you see is exactly
what your visitors will see.

23
00:01:23,883 --> 00:01:26,286
The settings panel controls the look.

24
00:01:26,286 --> 00:01:30,377
Change the font size and weight,
the alignment, and the colour.

25
00:01:30,377 --> 00:01:35,248
Spacing sets the gap above and below,
so you never need to add empty lines.

26
00:01:36,098 --> 00:01:38,335
To add something new, click the plus.

27
00:01:38,335 --> 00:01:42,022
Drag an element from the panel
and drop it where you want it.

28
00:01:42,022 --> 00:01:44,742
A blue line shows exactly
where it will land.

29
00:01:44,742 --> 00:01:47,281
Let's drop a video right below the button.

30
00:01:48,130 --> 00:01:51,430
The new video is selected,
so its settings are ready.

31
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:55,416
Paste the link from YouTube, Vimeo
or Wistia, and add a caption.

32
00:01:55,416 --> 00:01:59,712
Every element type has its own
settings, like the action of a button,

33
00:01:59,712 --> 00:02:01,082
or which form to show.

34
00:02:01,909 --> 00:02:04,573
The same panel adds rows and sections.

35
00:02:04,573 --> 00:02:06,886
Rows come in one to four columns.

36
00:02:06,886 --> 00:02:11,443
Sections come in four widths: full
width, wide, medium and small.

37
00:02:11,443 --> 00:02:14,667
Medium and small work
well for forms and text,

38
00:02:14,667 --> 00:02:17,542
because shorter lines are easier to read.

39
00:02:18,392 --> 00:02:20,115
Now switch to mobile view.

40
00:02:20,115 --> 00:02:22,699
Columns stack, and text shrinks to fit.

41
00:02:22,699 --> 00:02:25,350
You can set a separate mobile font size,

42
00:02:25,350 --> 00:02:28,531
so the headline isn't too
big on a small screen.

43
00:02:28,531 --> 00:02:30,651
That change only affects phones.

44
00:02:31,477 --> 00:02:34,459
You can also hide an
element on one device.

45
00:02:34,459 --> 00:02:40,214
Large images can slow a phone down, so
select the hero image and switch off Show on

46
00:02:40,214 --> 00:02:40,699
mobile.

47
00:02:40,699 --> 00:02:43,889
It stays on desktop, and
disappears on phones.

48
00:02:44,738 --> 00:02:49,253
Before you publish, preview the page
exactly as visitors will see it,

49
00:02:49,253 --> 00:02:50,888
on mobile and on desktop.

50
00:02:50,888 --> 00:02:53,571
Then exit the preview, save, and publish.

51
00:02:53,571 --> 00:02:56,450
Changes aren't live
until you click Publish.

52
00:02:57,299 --> 00:02:58,380
Here's a pro tip.

53
00:02:58,380 --> 00:03:02,577
Most visitors arrive on a phone,
especially from social media ads.

54
00:03:02,577 --> 00:03:06,010
So check every page in mobile
view before you publish,

55
00:03:06,010 --> 00:03:09,762
and make sure the main button
is visible without scrolling.

56
00:03:10,611 --> 00:03:13,453
You now know your way
around the page builder.

57
00:03:13,453 --> 00:03:18,642
Next, we'll build forms and surveys, add
conditional logic, and embed them anywhere.

58
00:03:18,642 --> 00:03:19,507
See you there.
